### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### 1. Create a conversation
POST http://localhost:5000/api/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Trip planning" }

### 2. Send a message (replace {{id}} with the Id returned above)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/conversations/{{id}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "I'm planning a 3-day trip to Rome in October. Any suggestions?" }

### 3. Inspect the persisted history
GET http://localhost:5000/api/conversations/{{id}}
